  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Anantha Kumar vs The Commissioner on 17 December, 2025 Author: Krishnan Ramasamy Bench: Krishnan Ramasamy W. Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated :17.12.2025 Coram: The Honourable Mr.Justice Krishnan Ramasamy W.P(MD)No. 36095 of 2025 and W.M.P.(Md) Nos.28679, 28680 & 28683 of 2025 Anantha Kumar . Vs 1.The Commissioner Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration, Dms Campus, 5th Floor, No.359, Annasalai, Tyenampet, Chennai - 6. 2.The Food Safety Officer, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department Food Safety Wing, Viruthunagar.",
    "facts": "This Writ Petition is filed challenging the impugned order passed by the third respondent dated 05.11.2025. The impugned order was passed under Section 32(3) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 r/w Rule 2.1.8(4) of the Food Safety and Standard (Food Business Licensing and Registration) Regulations, 2011, wherein the licence issued to the petitioner is temporarily suspended.",
    "arguments": "2. The learned counsel for the petitioner submitted that even though the appellate remedy is available, in many cases, this Court has entertained and revoked the order of suspension. Therefore, the petitioner has approached this Court.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "2. The learned counsel for the petitioner submitted that even though the appellate remedy is available, in many cases, this Court has entertained and revoked the order of suspension. Therefore, the petitioner has approached this Court.",
